---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "March 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | StayAtNiche"
  description="StayAtNiche participates in affiliate programs. Here's everything you need to know about how we earn commissions."
>

  <section class="relative bg-warm-50 overflow-hidden pt-10 pb-8">
    <div class="dot-pattern absolute inset-0 opacity-60 pointer-events-none" />
    <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-warm-500 text-sm font-body mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-warm-800 transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="text-warm-300">/</span>
        <span class="text-warm-800 font-medium">Affiliate Disclosure</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-warm-500 text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">

    <!-- Quick summary card -->
    <div class="bg-gold-50 border border-gold-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-gold-500 text-xl mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">✦</span>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-950 mb-1">The Short Version</h2>
          <p class="font-body text-warm-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            StayAtNiche earns a small commission when you book through our links — at <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>. This helps us keep the site running and the curation honest. We only recommend properties we genuinely believe are extraordinary.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose max-w-none font-body text-warm-700 leading-relaxed space-y-8">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">What is an Affiliate Program?</h2>
        <p>An affiliate program is a partnership between a website (us) and a business (e.g., Booking.com) where we earn a commission for referring customers. When you click a "Check Rates" or similar link on our site and complete a booking, the booking platform tracks that referral and pays us a percentage of the booking value.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">Which Programs Do We Use?</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">StayAtNiche participates in <strong class="text-warm-900">27 affiliate programs</strong>, all managed through Travelpayouts (marker ID: 478307). Here is the full list:</p>

        <!-- Accommodation -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🏨 Accommodation</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Expedia</strong> — hotel search and accommodation bookings (1.35–3.6% commission, 7-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Flights -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">✈ Flights</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Kiwi.com</strong> — flight search, combinations & nomad tickets (3% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Aviasales</strong> — flight search aggregator covering 100+ airlines (1.5–2% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Activities & Experiences -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🎭 Tours, Activities & Tickets</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Klook</strong> — tours, activities, and experiences (2–5% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Tiqets</strong> — attraction tickets and skip-the-line passes (3.5–8% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">WeGoTrip</strong> — audio guides and self-guided tours (8–12% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">TicketNetwork</strong> — concerts, sports, and event tickets (4–7% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Car Rental -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🚗 Car Rental</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Localrent</strong> — local car rental agencies worldwide (5–8% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">QEEQ</strong> — car rental comparison platform (5–7% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Auto Europe</strong> — car rental for Europe and worldwide (3–6% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">EconomyBookings</strong> — budget car rental bookings (5–8% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">GetRentacar</strong> — global car rental marketplace (5–7% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">intui.travel</strong> — car rental for popular destinations (5–8% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Transfers -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🚕 Airport Transfers</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Welcome Pickups</strong> — private airport transfers in 100+ cities (7–10% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">KiwiTaxi</strong> — airport and city-to-city transfers (7–10% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">GetTransfer</strong> — intercity transfer marketplace (5–8% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Other Transport -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🛵 Other Transportation</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">BikeBooking</strong> — bike, scooter and motorbike rentals (4–6% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">SEARADAR</strong> — boat, yacht and water sports rentals (5–8% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- eSIM & Connectivity -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">📱 eSIM & Mobile Connectivity</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Airalo</strong> — eSIM cards for 200+ countries (10–15% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Yesim</strong> — eSIM and virtual numbers for travellers (10–15% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Saily</strong> — eSIM data plans by NordVPN (10–15% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Drimsim</strong> — global SIM card for 190+ countries (8–12% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">NordVPN</strong> — VPN service for secure travel browsing (30–40% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Insurance & Compensation -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🛡 Insurance & Compensation</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">EKTA</strong> — travel insurance covering medical, cancellation and more (10–15% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">AirHelp</strong> — flight delay and cancellation compensation claims (25–30% of recovered amount, 30-day cookie)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Compensair</strong> — automated flight compensation service (25–30% of recovered amount, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Luggage -->
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-bold text-warm-800 mb-2 mt-5">🧳 Luggage Storage</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-warm-700 text-sm">
          <li><strong class="text-warm-900">Radical Storage</strong> — luggage storage in cities worldwide (7–10% commission, 30-day cookie)</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-warm-500">All programs are accessed via the Travelpayouts affiliate network. Commission rates shown are approximate ranges and may vary by product and region. Cookie lifetime indicates how long after a click we may receive credit for a booking or signup.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">Does This Affect You?</h2>
        <p class="mb-3"><strong class="text-warm-900">No extra cost to you.</strong> Affiliate commissions are paid by the merchant from their margin. The price you pay is exactly the same whether you book through our link or go directly to the platform.</p>
        <p>In some cases, our affiliate relationships give us access to exclusive deals or rates that we pass directly to our readers.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">Does Affiliate Income Affect Our Recommendations?</h2>
        <p class="mb-3"><strong class="text-warm-900">Absolutely not.</strong> Our editorial independence is non-negotiable. Properties are featured on StayAtNiche because we believe they are genuinely extraordinary — not because of any commercial arrangement.</p>
        <p class="mb-3">We do not accept payment to feature properties. We do not guarantee coverage in exchange for affiliate arrangements. Our curation process is based entirely on uniqueness, quality, guest satisfaction, and wow-factor.</p>
        <p>If a property ceases to meet our standards, it gets removed — regardless of any affiliate relationship.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">FTC Compliance</h2>
        <p>This disclosure is made in accordance with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidelines on endorsements and testimonials in advertising (16 C.F.R. Part 255). If you have questions about this disclosure, please <a href="/contact" class="text-forest-600 hover:underline">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-warm-950 mb-3">Questions?</h2>
        <p>We're committed to transparency. If you have any questions about our affiliate relationships or anything else on the site, we'd love to hear from you via our <a href="/contact" class="text-forest-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
